# Bake an RG DFG lookup. X is perceptual roughness; Y is normal/view cosine.
# Parameters: width, height, sample count, reserved. Bake once per configuration.
import ../scene_sampling.dl
import lib/shader.dl

set parameters to the shader uniform named "integration" at binding 0 as @intrinsic("vector", 4)
set roughness to (the fragment x coordinate) / (the element at 0 in parameters)
set cosine to (the fragment y coordinate) / (the element at 1 in parameters)
set count to (the element at 2 in parameters) as an integer
set coefficients to the UI scene DFG coefficients at roughness roughness view cosine cosine using count samples
set the fragment color with a red channel of (the x of coefficients), a green channel of (the y of coefficients), a blue channel of 0.0 and an alpha channel of 1.0
